    "title": "SFISHTRACK: A Dataset for Fish Segmentation and Tracking in Underwater Videos",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20617668",
    "publication_date": "2026-06-09",
    "description": "<p>A high-quality underwater video dataset for fish segmentation and multi-object tracking, featuring pixel-level annotations, temporally consistent identities, and structured metadata from diverse marine environments in the Balearic Sea. Designed for benchmarking and developing underwater computer vision methods.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>To refer to scripts used for visualizing the data please consult the github link added to the code repository found in this page. In case of need for citation we encourage to follow the instructions written at the end of the Github page. For further questions please contact Josep, S&aacute;nchez.</p>",
